---
import DefaultLayout from '@layouts/DefaultLayout.astro'
import { Heading, Link } from 'accessible-astro-components'
---

<DefaultLayout title="My Forest Laboratory — Kuvempu PEACE" useTitleTemplate={false}>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/kupeace/images/forest-laboratory-deer2.jpg"
      alt="Spotted deer with antlers standing in the forest near the Kuvempu University campus"
      class="w-full h-[50vh] object-cover"
    />
    <div class="container mx-auto py-12 text-center">
      <Heading level="h1" class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">My Campus, My Forest Laboratory</Heading>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Kuvempu University is exceptionally gifted — embedded right within the Western Ghats forest landscape, adjacent to the Bhadra Tiger Reserve. This isn't scenery around our campus; it's part of the campus itself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="my-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-8 text-lg">
        We work closely with the Forest Department, policymakers, and conservation practitioners across the landscape, and this ongoing research relationship is something every student — not just those in Environmental Science, Botany, or Wildlife — should know closely.
      </p>

      <Heading level="h2" class="mb-4">Collaboration Across Departments</Heading>
      <p class="mb-8 text-lg">
        Wildlife, Environmental Science, and Botany regularly organize joint events showcasing the forest the campus is embedded within — from guided walks to biodiversity surveys.
      </p>

      <Heading level="h2" class="mb-4">Know Your Forest</Heading>
      <p class="mb-8 text-lg">
        Students can get involved in identifying and naming campus trees, tracking their seasonality — flowering and fruiting — and observing the fauna, particularly the frugivores that depend on them. The woodpecker in the photo below was spotted right on campus.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <img
        src="/kupeace/images/forest-laboratory-woodpecker.jpg"
        alt="A woodpecker clinging to a tree trunk on the Kuvempu University campus"
        class="w-full rounded-lg shadow-md object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto text-center max-w-3xl">
      <blockquote class="text-2xl md:text-3xl italic font-medium mb-12">
        "The forest is not merely around the campus. The forest is part of the campus experience."
      </blockquote>
      <Link
        href="/kupeace/activities"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#123b6d] text-[#dbeafe] font-semibold no-underline hover:bg-[#0f2f57] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#60a5fa]"
        style="text-decoration: none !important;"
      >
        See Forest Walks &amp; Activities
      </Link>
    </div>
  </section>
</DefaultLayout>
